code.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176457512,"discussion_id":"aabf89638ce014d7aa14ac62dbd5cea7e716a0b4","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-22T09:48:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-22T09:48:00+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176457748,"discussion_id":"aebd26a09672968b876b12cb243013cd0dfe41c5","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修改 `math/cummin/op_kernel/arch35/cummin.h` 中 `SimtCompute` 函数的累积最小值比较逻辑，旨在修复 NaN 处理问题。核心改动是将比较表达式从 `curr_val <= minVal` 翻转为 `minVal < curr_val`，并相应调整三元运算符的分支。对于普通值两者等价；对于 NaN，新逻辑解决了「首元素为 NaN 导致后续所有输出均为 NaN」的问题，但也引入了「中间位置出现 NaN 时 NaN 会向后传播」的行为变化。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **比较逻辑翻转**：`const bool is_smaller = (curr_val <= minVal)` 改为 `bool is_not_smaller = (minVal < curr_val)`，三元运算符的 then/else 分支也对应交换（第56-58行）。这使得当 `minVal` 初始为 NaN 时可以被后续正常值替换，但当 `curr_val` 为 NaN 时 NaN 会传播进 `minVal`。\n- **`const` 限定符丢失**：新变量 `is_not_smaller` 声明时遗漏了原代码中 `const bool` 的 `const` 限定符（第56行），属于代码风格回退。\n- **缩进格式不一致**：第58行 `minIdx = ...` 的缩进混用了 tab 与空格，与同代码块中其余纯空格缩进的行不一致。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-22T09:48:59+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-22T09:48:59+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176459067,"discussion_id":"da0a4e660829d84da2471d2d207df6422ab057fb","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-06-22T09:55:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-22T09:55:23+08:00","user":{"id":"6822c634e4b985165b4b055f","login":"FelixTang7","object_id":"6822c634e4b985165b4b055f","name":"FelixTang7","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/FelixTang7"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176548748,"discussion_id":"77e41e18f3a9c4ebd1370ed36ed3c71691447127","body":"/approve","created_at":"2026-06-22T16:54:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-22T16:54:23+08:00","user":{"id":"6822d582053cff786c910efe","login":"rxtfeng","object_id":"6822d582053cff786c910efe","name":"rxtfeng","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/rxtfeng"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"}]